<title>USA: Alcan hikes US price 3 cents to 83 cents/lb.</title>
<headline>Alcan hikes US price 3 cents to 83 cents/lb.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcan Aluminium of Canada said it raised its U.S. list price for ingot by three cents to 83 cents a lb, effective June 1.</p>
<p>The list price for extrusion billet was raised the same to 93 cents, effective the same date.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
